  "description": "# SIP2.53.2: Add 2 Arks to LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 2 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n- Number of Arks to add: 2\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0x539b7f974cC8E19D7376003877965dFD5E4C97b2`\n2. `0x8Ec71E0D225B4213A95E669A7286E6D5637462c7`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-53-re-deploy-existing-morpho-v2-markets-with-updated-arks/739\n",
